        "water seem to like it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "A long and thin bench.\n",
        "The kind you would find in\n",
        "any park or rest area."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "A short, horizontal fence.\n",
        "If you used a few of these, you could\n",
        "probably enclose a lake or flower patch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "A short, vertical fence.\n",
        "If you used a few of these, you could\n",
        "probably enclose a lake or flower patch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "A long, horizontal fence.\n",
        "If you used a few of these, you could\n",
        "probably enclose a lake or flower patch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "A long, vertical fence.\n",
