      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "A signboard made of wood. If you\n",
        "planted a stake in the ground, you\n",
        "could post this sign on it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "A stone statue made in your image.\n",
        "If you placed this, you could really\n",
        "get the sense of being a great hero."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "Your own flag that you drew. If you\n",
        "placed this, you could really get the\n",
        "sense of being the ruler of the land."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00058",
      "en_US": [
        "An electric light that illuminates the\n",
        "Area. If placed in the darkness, it could\n",
        "create a beautiful path of light."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00059",
      "en_US": [
        "A sign pointing right. Any person who\n",
        "sees this would naturally want to go find\n",
        "out what it could be pointing to."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0430_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "A sign pointing left. Any person who\n",
        "sees this would naturally want to go find\n",
